{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.poster.avif?t=1771771021\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.webm?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/7138318d52cc9deddb510d717d5b2dfa.mp4?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cOPERATIVES: revolve\u201d</strong> is a cinematic roguelike deckbuilder with multiple unique gameplay mechanics. Play as <strong>Operatives</strong>, secret agents chosen to enforce the will of the <strong>Machine Doctrine</strong>. In this world, humanity didn\u2019t invent technology; it was <i>placed into our hands</i> when the Doctrine descended in our most primitive age, <strong>propelling</strong>\u00a0<strong>civilization forward and sowing the chaos that followed</strong>. Wield Machine cards to strike and block in physical combat, hunt down those who resist your directive, and uncover the hidden truths behind this machinated world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/361d58961f853959d6d0efcd29bdc65f.avif?t=1771771021\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card can be upgraded by installing unique <strong>Chassis\u00a0</strong>and <strong>Wheel</strong> components. Each component boasts its own distinct design and effects. Utilize them to optimize your cards and experiment with different gameplay strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/4ce7af2700cc6dc0b27714bc00352c46.poster.avif?t=1771771021\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/4ce7af2700cc6dc0b27714bc00352c46.webm?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Destructible Cards</strong> - Cards have a unique health system, indicated by their Wheel. They can be destroyed in combat, adding a unique strategic layer to how you manage your cards. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/c3811c02cd32138f66629cec067ab2d9.avif?t=1771771021\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toolkits and Assets\u00a0</strong>- Powerful resources that further improve your component-card combos or create new gameplay strategies. These toolkits can be swapped out at any time to adjust your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/9ce59edf9e8b875dd23452f376cc8bbc.poster.avif?t=1771771021\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/9ce59edf9e8b875dd23452f376cc8bbc.webm?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/9ce59edf9e8b875dd23452f376cc8bbc.mp4?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/f8b5f63633deddaafb509f80130068b0.avif?t=1771771021\" width=616 height=201 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Intense Visual and Combat</strong> -\u00a0Featuring combat with visual that can reshape how each fight plays. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.poster.avif?t=1771771021\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.webm?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/03c9b3c78db814ae82358d3df894ff33.mp4?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Mechanics</strong> - Feature complex, multi-synergy to chain your strategies into powerful combos with intense visual feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.poster.avif?t=1771771021\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.webm?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/843e7d2c6eba7ed5dc0265f358e886fd.mp4?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.poster.avif?t=1771771021\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.webm?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/84e0b935d40ffca5043532a20e8ebc7e.mp4?t=1771771021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Challenge</strong> - Enemies come in varied forms and employ dynamic attack strategies. Enemy behaviors can be rolled and remixed each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Replayability</strong> - Each run is different. Select 2 out of 6 Operatives to battle against enemies with evolving behaviors, experiencing a myriad of interactions with the Operatives, world building, and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Multi-Directional</strong> - Card placement is key to your strategy, enemies will attack from different directions.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Combination Deck</strong> - Each Operative has their own set of unique cards, designed to synergize differently when paired with a different Operative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Optimization</strong> - This game is optimized to run smoothly on older devices. We aim to launch with <strong>Steam Deck Verified</strong> support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/b405a397512beeaeaa6e86c030503426.avif?t=1771771021\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004810/extras/a1e2439a8aa77d3cd9ee460418300d47.avif?t=1771771021\" width=616 height=132 /><